\description{
Screen group differences on a selected measurement \code{facet} using either
baseline-model residuals (\code{method = "residual"}) or anchor-linked subgroup
refits (\code{method = "refit"}).

The former \code{analyze_dif()} name is no longer exported. Use \code{\link[=analyze_dff]{analyze_dff()}};
the calculation and saved result class are unchanged.

\code{summary()} returns the contrast, cell, summary, and configuration tables
without refitting. A summary from \code{\link[=analyze_dff]{analyze_dff()}} keeps its DFF label when
printed; a saved \code{mfrm_dif} summary keeps its DIF label.

Compare saved group contrasts as ordered bars, a heatmap, or a paired
two-group scatterplot with optional marginal histograms. Read the
analysis method and scale before interpreting the size of a difference.
}
